{"ref":"BDB, שָׁמֵן²","hw":"שָׁמֵן²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמֵן</span></big>  <strong>adj. fat, robust</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> m. <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:29\" href=\"/Judges.3.29\">Ju 3:29</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמֵנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:20\" href=\"/Genesis.49.20\">Gn 49:20</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>fat, rich</em>, of food, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:20\" href=\"/Genesis.49.20\">Gn 49:20</a> (poem in J), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.23\">Is 30:23</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּשֵׁן</span>), <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.16\">Hb 1:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִאָה</span>); of land, <em>fertile</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:20\" href=\"/Numbers.13.20\">Nu 13:20</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.25\">Ne 9:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.35\">35</a>, pasturage <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.14\">Ez 34:14</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.40\">1 Ch 4:40</a>. (<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.9\">1 S 15:9</a> v. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁנֶה</span> 3).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>stout, robust</em>, of men <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:29\" href=\"/Judges.3.29\">Ju 3:29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ חַיִל</span>; v. GFM); f. coll. (fig. of flock) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.16\">Ez 34:16</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֲזָקָה</span>).","next":"BDB, שָׁמָן","prev":"BDB, שָׁמֵן"}